  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Multi-sectoral Life-saving Assistance for Conflict-affected Populations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to address malnutrition among conflict-affected households, especially during the lean season, with increased access to a nutritious diet and clean water while receiving critical health services, nutritional education, protection services, and building their resilience to shocks. the total number of beneficiaries that will be supported under this award is 170,571 individuals.</narrative>
  </description>
